{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"日本超級電腦「富岳」遭外部非法訪問　恐洩露企業機密資料\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/JP-COMPUTER-261116-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】日本超級電腦「富岳」運作系統遭外部非法訪問，可能有企業機密資料被洩露。</p><p>營運「富岳」的日本理化學研究所向上級日本文部科學省報告遭到非法訪問。這個耗資1300億日圓建成的國家核心超級電腦，可用於大學研究汽車、製藥等產品研發，客戶包括住友橡膠工業，日本製鐵、田邊三菱製藥等。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.704931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:22:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T05:12:51.595343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:38.160568+00:00","content_hash":"6ab08ca522dba9685ee904edfd28b354b4bb81d5b69e6071b5392a639c287f9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.704931+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}